"value":2,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3318840","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3305190-1847286114032374","game_id":"steam-3305190","kind":"announcement","title":"One More Plate! Launches November 10! 🍽️","summary":"We finally have a release date:One More Plate! launches on November 10!We’re getting close now, and we’d love to hear what you think if you’ve played the demo — what you enjoyed, what felt confusing, any bugs you ran into, or anything else you’d like to tell us.You’re also very welcome to join our communities:Discord:https://discord.com/invite/HkXPbMh5vPQQ Group:https://qm.qq.com/q/t2zJNyThHa (for Chinese-speaking players)And if you’re looking for someone to play with, feel free to ask in the co","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T12:06:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032374","verified_at":"2026-10-22T14:18:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3305190-1846651706674374","game_id":"steam-3305190","kind":"announcement","title":"Cook and serve One More Plate! at Steam Cooking Fest 🍳","summary":"Cook and serve One More Plate! at Steam Cooking Fest 🍳Step 1. Catch the food. Step 2. Keep it on whatever somehow counts as a plate. Step 3. Feed the monster.Sounds easy enough, right?The demo is free on Steam — come try it solo or with a friend, and see how long that confidence lasts. 😎— Okawari!Share your feedback in the Steam Discussions or join our communities:Discord: https://discord.com/invite/HkXPbMh5vP QQ Group: https://qm.qq.com/q/t2zJNyThHa(for Chinese-speaking players)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T13:59:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674374","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3305190-1844115010503055","game_id":"steam-3305190","kind":"announcement","title":"Multiplayer Game Fest is here! 🎮","summary":"Multiplayer Game Fest is here! 🎮Two players, one more plate, zero accountability.Play One More Plate! together, make a mess, and blame each other accordingly.📺 Watch live on Steam 🍽️ Demo is free to playMake sure to bring a friend. You’ll need someone to blame.Share your feedback in the Steam Discussions or join our communities:Share your feedback in the Steam Discussions or join our communities:Discord: https://discord.com/invite/HkXPbMh5vP QQ Group: https://qm.qq.com/q/t2zJNyThHa(for Chinese-s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T04:02:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010503055","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3305190-1843481262704370","game_id":"steam-3305190","kind":"announcement","title":"Streaming from Tokyo Game Show 2026! 🎮","summary":"Hello from Okawari!We’re heading to Tokyo Game Show 2026 with One More Plate! as part of SELECTED INDIE 80, and while we’re there, we’ll also be streaming the game live here on Steam!If you’re coming to TGS, come say hi to us in person! If not, hang out with us from home and watch the chaos unfold.📅 Sept.17~21 📍 Makuhari Messe, Selected Indie 80 Area, Booth E-34 🗺️ Find us on the TGS map 📺 Or, Watch live right here on SteamSee you at TGS! 🍽️— Okawari!#And a little something for anyone who stops ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T11:57:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262704370","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3305190-1841579228665835","game_id":"steam-3305190","kind":"announcement","title":"🎮 Steam China Showcase Live Streaming!","summary":"🎮 We're live for the Steam China Showcase!One More Plate! is a chaotic party game about one simple job: feed the hungry monsters before they lose it. Rotate the plate, guide the food, make a little physics mess — solo, or squished on the couch with friends.😎 Or, beat the dev in the new demo! 祥子 already took the Boss record with 00:54:99, putting me in second at 00:58:01🥈 So yes, the dev can be beaten. But I'm still #1 on Level 1 with 003352🥇Who's taking Level 1? Come get me!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T14:44:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228665835","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3305190-1839676055890151","game_id":"steam-3305190","kind":"announcement","title":"The New One More Plate Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"The newly updated demo adds Versus mode, a brand-new world filled with new monsters, and global leaderboards. Whether you’ve played before or are joining your first shift, there is now even more chaos to discover.Download the updated demo and give it a try today! Hello from Okawari!We are Okawari!, a two-person indie studio based in Kyoto, Japan. Okawari means “one more serving, please”—and that’s exactly what we hope you’ll say after playing our game!One More Plate is our first game, and we wou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-01T07:21:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055890151","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3305190-1837955055356989","game_id":"steam-3305190","kind":"announcement","title":"TOKYO GAME SHOW 2026","summary":"(Still processing this.💭)(Curled my hair into 'TGS' after the processing.💅)One More Plate! is officially part of TOKYO GAME SHOW 2026 — SELECTED INDIE 80!! We checked the list twice. Three times. It's real. 🎉We're two hungry, busy monsters with day jobs, making this game after work, so… this one's going on the fridge!🏅 Thank you for every single wishlist that got us here!September 17–21, Makuhari Messe. After BitSummit, this is our second time on a show floor, basically veterans now.😏 Come feed ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T14:15:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055356989","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3305190-1806064758577858","game_id":"steam-3305190","kind":"announcement","title":"🎌We went to BitSummit the 13th: Summer of Yokai!","summary":"Hello everyone!Last weekend, we had the joy of showcasing ONE MORE PLATE! at BitSummit in Kyoto — Japan’s biggest indie game festival! 🍱✨This time, we presented our Japan-themed world, full of hungry yokai, weird plates and food! The demo booth was packed and we were blown away by the laughter, screams and chaos from all of you who stopped by - it was so much fun seeing real players enjoy the game in person! We’re bringing all this love and energy back into development, and we can’t wait to serv","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-23T13:32:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806064758577858","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3305190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:36:16Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_las